@startuml

start

:Supervisory network stack initializes;
:Validate external environmental conditions meet operating specifications;
:Check device interface connectivity;

if (Prerequisites satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Verify sensor data validity via CRC check;
  :Initialize data acquisition module;

  :Under fixed-priority preemptive model;
  :Deterministic, multi-threaded scheduler within RTOS launches concurrent tasks;

  fork
    :High-priority periodic task;
    :Continuous device status monitoring managed by watchdog;
  fork again
    :Parallel threads for ring buffer management;
  fork again
    :Parallel threads for network communication;
  end fork

  :Network module initialization;
  :Spawn second set of deterministic tasks;
  fork
    :Timer-driven telemetry loop;
    :Dispatch data to cloud server via CAN bus/similar protocol;
    :Bounded retries and backoff on transmission faults;
  fork again
    :Mutex-protected priority queue;
    :Handle concurrent parsing and publishing;
  fork again
    :Dedicated ISR mirrors critical status to central FADEC or BMS;
  end fork

  :Terminate all tasks gracefully;
  :Modules closed by PMIC in controlled sequence;
  :System enters safe standby state;

else (no)
end if

stop

@enduml
